eather warning service","url":"https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/guides/warnings","verified":"Red warnings are reserved for dangerous weather and require direct action to protect people from serious impacts.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"MET_WARN_07","direct_score_input":false},{"row":118,"status":"PASS_MET_WARN_08","source":"Met Office severe-weather warning service","url":"https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/guides/severe-weather-advice","verified":"Not every location inside a warning area will necessarily experience the same impacts.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"MET_WARN_08","direct_score_input":false},{"row":119,"status":"PASS_WITH_MET_WARN_09","source":"Met Office severe-weather warning service","url":"https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/guides/warnings","verified":"Severe-weather risk depends on weather type, location, likelihood, impact, exposure, vulnerability, infrastructure and preceding conditions.","quality_score":"3","adoption":"MET_WARN_GUARD_09","direct_score_input":false},{"row":120,"status":"PASS_WITH_MET_WARN_10","source":"Met Office severe-weather warning service","url":"https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/guides/severe-weather-advice","verified":"Met Office warning evidence is forecast-, location-, weather-, impact-, likelihood-, exposure- and time-specific and is not an exact parcel-level loss probability.","quality_score":"3","adoption":"MET_WARN_GUARD_10","direct_score_input":false}]}